                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Personally....I think this game deserve more recommendation. I think it's because this is like an Origin story of who framed roger rabbit before who framed roger rabbit came out where the real world and toonworld (or toontown to that matter) rejoiced to the level where they agree to live together after being discovered by Christopher Lloyd lad himself. Buuuut also somewhere that he would turn to the darkside and thus that Judge doom was born and that he would get toonified to the process. And thus having the fatal story of how eddie valiant lost his brother after the incident. (ik this sounds all crazy and what not or overthinking it, but I feel as if this game was a story driven build up on purpose when they we're making the game. And I'm including Virgin Interactive)\n\nAnyways. main point, This game is extremely fun. colorful, and the best voice cast if I ever heard them. A very interesting story as well. And a ton of stuff it has to offer seeing how amazing the animation is.",
